  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:290px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-lightgreen pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Bio-Absorbing Replication</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/50/Manifest_Tamaki_Amajiki.png/revision/latest?cb=20191202003725\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Manifest Tamaki Amajiki\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/50/Manifest_Tamaki_Amajiki.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20191202003725\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/50/Manifest_Tamaki_Amajiki.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20191202003725 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/50/Manifest_Tamaki_Amajiki.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20191202003725 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Manifest Tamaki Amajiki\" width=\"270\" height=\"290\" data-image-key=\"Manifest_Tamaki_Amajiki.png\" data-image-name=\"Manifest Tamaki Amajiki.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Tamaki Amajiki’s (My Hero Academia) Quirk, Manifest, allows him to replicate and manipulate the properties of whatever he consumes.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Bio-absorb and replicate</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The power to <b>bio-energetically absorb and replicate anything</b>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Sourcing\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Sourcing\">Bio-Energetic Sourcing</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Evolving_Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Evolving Absorbing Replication\">Evolving Absorbing Replication</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Matter_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Energy Matter Manipulation\">Bio-Energy Matter Manipulation</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBio-Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Bio-Assimilation</b></li>\n<li>Bio-Energetic Shapeshifting</li>\n<li>Evolving Bio-System</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBio-Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can bio-energetically absorb/replicate anything; as can draw any material or&#160;force into themselves, making it their own. The user can then replicate as well as manifest the properties of whatever they have assimilated into their evolving bio-system that can also manipulate, augment, and alter what they’ve absorbed. When users can also use their bio-energy to shift any and all properties of what they assimilated to their will. This allows them to manifest anything they desire made from whatever they’ve previously consumed as it’s encoded into the user down to the aspects and principles without having having to constantly absorb it, as much as they can re-customize it become something entirely to the user’s advantages. User's bio-system can potentially reach down to the quantum mechanics, making it possible to understand and control anything they absorb, replicate, augment, and manipulate straight to conceptual levels, such as probabilities, space-time, and reality, adding to their system.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBio-Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Alternative_Sustenance\" title=\"Alternative Sustenance\">Alternative Sustenance</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Sourcing\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Sourcing\">Bio-Energetic Sourcing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Energy Manipulation\">Bio-Energy Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Emulation\" title=\"Energy Emulation\">Energy Emulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Matter_Absorption\" title=\"Matter Absorption\">Matter Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Matter_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Matter Manipulation\">Bio-Matter Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Property_Replication\" title=\"Property Replication\">Property Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Quality_Enhancement\" title=\"Quality Enhancement\">Quality Enhancement</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Reality_Consumption\" title=\"Reality Consumption\">Reality Consumption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Reality_Condition\" title=\"Reality Condition\">Reality Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Space-Time_Absorption\" title=\"Space-Time Absorption\">Space-Time Absorption</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Digestive_Assimilation\" title=\"Digestive Assimilation\">Digestive Assimilation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ingestive_Technoforming\" title=\"Ingestive Technoforming\">Ingestive Technoforming</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Amalgamorphing\" title=\"Amalgamorphing\">Amalgamorphing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Meta-Morphic_Conversion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Meta-Morphic Conversion\">Meta-Morphic Conversion</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Factory\" title=\"Living Factory\">Living Factory</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Arsenal\" title=\"Living Arsenal\">Living Arsenal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Database\" title=\"Living Database\">Living Database</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Laboratory\" title=\"Living Laboratory\">Living Laboratory</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Customization\" title=\"Personal Customization\">Personal Customization</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Attributes\" title=\"Personal Attributes\">Personal Attributes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Status\" title=\"Personal Status\">Personal Status</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Effect_Extension\" title=\"Effect Extension\">Effect Extension</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Remote_Technoformation\" title=\"Remote Technoformation\">Remote Technoformation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Accumulation\" title=\"Power Accumulation\">Power Accumulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Direct_Technoforming\" title=\"Direct Technoforming\">Formulative Technoforming</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Mastery\" title=\"Self-Mastery\">Self-Mastery</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptive_Appearance\" title=\"Adaptive Appearance\">Adaptive Appearance</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Battle_Shifting\" title=\"Battle Shifting\">Battle Shifting</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptation_Inducement\" title=\"Adaptation Inducement\">Adaptation Inducement</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Shiftmorphing\" title=\"Shiftmorphing\">Shiftmorphing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Evolving_Fusionism\" title=\"Evolving Fusionism\">Evolving Fusionism</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Biomechatronitology\" title=\"Biomechatronitology\">Biomechatronitology</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Tech_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Tech Manipulation\">Bio-Tech Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Chromosomal_Interface\" title=\"Chromosomal Interface\">Chromosomal Interface</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bodywork_Manipulation\" title=\"Bodywork Manipulation\">Bodywork Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Body_Modification\" title=\"Body Modification\">Body Modification</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Biology_Manipulation\" title=\"Personal Biology Manipulation\">Personal Biology Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Genesis_Creation\" title=\"Genesis Creation\">Genesis Creation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Mutation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Mutation\">Personal Mutation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Fission\" title=\"Self-Fission\">Self-Fission</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tactile_Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Tactile Absorbing Replication\">Tactile</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Remote_Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Remote Absorbing Replication\">Remote Absorbing Replication</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Biophysical_Possession\" title=\"Biophysical Possession\">Biophysical Possession</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Evolving_Power_Replication\" title=\"Evolving Power Replication\">Evolving Power Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Reach_Manipulation\" title=\"Reach Manipulation\">Reach Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Access_Manipulation\" title=\"Access Manipulation\">Access Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Engineering_Manipulation\" title=\"Engineering Manipulation\">Engineering Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Omnireplication\" title=\"Omnireplication\">Omnireplication</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Total_Mimicry\" title=\"Total Mimicry\">Total Mimicry</a> (By perfectly replicating everything from others without limit)</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Techniques\">Techniques</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBio-Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptive_Attribute_Assimilation\" title=\"Adaptive Attribute Assimilation\">Adaptive Attribute Assimilation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Information_Archiving\" title=\"Ability Information Archiving\">Ability Information Archiving</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Power Augmentation\">Power Augmentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Mixture\" title=\"Power Mixture\">Power Mixture</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Property_Conglomeration\" title=\"Property Conglomeration\">Property Conglomeration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Property_Transference\" title=\"Property Transference\">Property Transference</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Almighty_Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Almighty Absorbing Replication\">Almighty Absorbing Replication</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBio-Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Tier_Activation\" title=\"Ability Tier Activation\">Ability Tier Activation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Absorbing Replication\">Absorbing Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Evolving_Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Evolving Absorbing Replication\">Evolving Absorbing Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Matter_Manipulation\" title=\"Matter Manipulation\">Matter Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Manipulation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Manipulation\">Power Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a h